  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter",
    "1 (8 ounce) loaf crusty French bread, cut into bite-sized pieces, or more as needed",
    "2 cups milk",
    "6 large eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "1 tablespoon brown sugar, or to taste",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/q0rLLwfERX9I5fHx_B6XIEFBocY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240502-easy-french-toast-casserole-DDMFS-ingredients-3x4-01350640-93448b3bc127481abdef2ef88af14ec8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240502/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the French toast: Stir brown sugar and butter together in a saucepan over medium-low heat until butter is melted and sugar has dissolved, 2 to 4 minutes. Pour butter-brown sugar mixture into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5bMpVGbpAXge-J_Bg0b2XB9JGnc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240502-easy-french-toast-casserole-DDMFS-step3-3x4-01350646-a1166cc615c04c649175e42698db836a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240502/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Scatter French bread pieces over top in a 1 ½- to 2-inch layer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H36NIpHuHGABbHsWyIKUR-61WRg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240502-easy-french-toast-casserole-DDMFS-step4-3x4-01350647-54518d7cb7f942e4b44fc1795482269f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240502/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk milk, eggs, and vanilla together in a bowl until well combined. Pour over bread pieces, then press bread down with a spatula so the bread absorbs the liquid. Cover with plastic wrap and refrigerate for 8 hours to overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9IbtiP0jMaIK6hik-LYlE1l5VGE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240502-easy-french-toast-casserole-DDMFS-step8-3x4-013506440950-87663899753e488289e343732adbe370.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240502/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When ready to bake, remove French toast from the refrigerator and discard plastic wrap. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the topping: Mix brown sugar and cinnamon together in a small bowl; sprinkle evenly over the top of French toast.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bpYuFK6HbYH9PR0uOImtXzioiR4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240502-easy-french-toast-casserole-DDMFS-step10-3x4-013506440955-ee39589f21d1425b9182b87f0e01f43a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240502/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until casserole is golden brown and set in the center, 50 to 60 minutes..",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tZ-I-qI-sKLBwCzYdgh7Ir7O7wA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240502-easy-french-toast-casserole-DDMFS-step11-3x4-013506440977-87c4d726d78c48778c66e8e66b7a9e0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240502/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut into squares; serve with some of the caramel from the bottom of the pan spooned on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tWkhP9j9w_8ZsWNjAIYzNEIMRsc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/240502-easy-french-toast-casserole-DDMFS-beauty-2-3x4-01350640-4c00b5925c58422f8a22205944a685d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240502/step_08.webp"
    }
