    "description": "When you have guests over, there’s nothing better than a homemade breakfast casserole to serve in the morning, especially when you can make it the night before. In this video, Nicole shows you how to make French toast with an easy casserole recipe that takes everything you love about French toast – the caramelized flavors and crusty-yet-soft texture – and leaves out the not-so-great parts – standing over a hot stove and flipping pieces of French toast while your guests wait. It’s an affordable way to feed a crowd, and every creamy, pillowy bite will leave them totally speechless.",
